      "chunk_text": "The customer, Kriti Mahajan, called insurance agent Karan Joshi to inquire about a missing confirmation for her health policy renewal and payment submitted last week. The agent confirmed that the payment was processed successfully, but a payment gateway issue prevented the automated confirmation email from being sent. The agent manually updated the system status and sent the confirmation email during the call.",
